      "text": "Levites … were not numbered among them, Num. 1:47. give the Levites unto Aaron and to his sons, Num. 3:9. take the Levites for me, Num. 3:41. separate the Levites … the Levites shall be mine, Num. 8:14. taken the Levites for all the firstborn, Num. 8:18. they give unto the Levites … cities to dwell in, Num. 35:2. thou forsake not the Levite as long as thou livest, Deut. 12:19. Levites … shall have no part nor inheritance, Deut. 18:1. certain Levite … who took to him a concubine, Judg. 19:1. Levites were appointed unto all manner of service, 1 Chr. 6:48. None ought to carry the ark of God but the Levites, 1 Chr. 15:2. he set the Levites in the house of the Lord, 2 Chr. 29:25. Levites were more upright in heart, 2 Chr. 29:34. Levites, had the oversight of the outward business, Neh. 11:16.",
